   var field=typeof(UniversalRenderPipelineAsset).GetField("m_RendererDataList",BindingFlags.Instance|BindingFlags.NonPublic);var data=(field?.GetValue(pipe) as ScriptableRendererData[])?.OfType<UniversalRendererData>().Single(d=>d.name=="ES_S2_ForwardRenderer");Check(data,"Actual S2 Renderer reference");var features=data.rendererFeatures.Where(f=>f&&f.GetType().Name=="ScreenSpaceAmbientOcclusion").ToArray();Check(features.Length==1,"S2 SSAO feature");var featureStates=features.Select(f=>f.isActive).ToArray();var additional=camera.GetUniversalAdditionalCameraData();var pp=additional.renderPostProcessing;var occ=camera.useOcclusionCulling;var motor=station.Player;var motorState=motor.enabled;var presentation=station.Echo.GetComponent<EchoPresentation>();var presentationState=presentation.enabled;var renderers=station.Echo.GetComponentsInChildren<Renderer>();var rendererStates=renderers.Select(r=>r.enabled).ToArray();var lights=station.gameObject.scene.GetRootGameObjects().SelectMany(r=>r.GetComponentsInChildren<Light>()).Where(l=>l.bakingOutput.lightmapBakeType==LightmapBakeType.Realtime).ToArray();var lightStates=lights.Select(l=>l.enabled).ToArray();foreach(var f in features)f.SetActive(false);foreach(var l in lights)l.enabled=false;foreach(var r in renderers)r.enabled=false;presentation.enabled=false;additional.renderPostProcessing=false;Position(new Vector3(0,.05f,-5.5f),90);motor.enabled=false;
   try{using var draws=ProfilerRecorder.StartNew(ProfilerCategory.Render,"Draw Calls Count",1);Check(draws.Valid,"PVS draw counter");using var frames=new SceneFrameCapture(camera);report.pvsDraws=new long[4];Color[] baseline=null;for(var stage=0;stage<4;stage++){camera.useOcclusionCulling=(stage&1)==1;for(var i=0;i<30;i++)yield return null;var pixels=frames.Capture(Path.Combine(folder,"Pvs_"+stage+".png"));if(stage==0){baseline=pixels;report.pvsBrightness=(float)pixels.Average(c=>(double)(c.r+c.g+c.b)/3);yield return null;report.pvsStableDifference=SceneFrameCapture.Difference(baseline,frames.Capture());}else report.pvsDifference=Math.Max(report.pvsDifference,SceneFrameCapture.Difference(baseline,pixels));var values=new long[60];for(var i=0;i<60;i++){yield return null;values[i]=draws.LastValue;}Array.Sort(values);report.pvsDraws[stage]=values[30];}Check(report.pvsBrightness>.001f&&report.pvsDraws[2]>report.pvsDraws[3],"PVS second round/no black image");}
   finally{for(var i=0;i<features.Length;i++)features[i].SetActive(featureStates[i]);for(var i=0;i<lights.Length;i++)if(lights[i])lights[i].enabled=lightStates[i];for(var i=0;i<renderers.Length;i++)if(renderers[i])renderers[i].enabled=rendererStates[i];presentation.enabled=presentationState;additional.renderPostProcessing=pp;camera.useOcclusionCulling=occ;motor.enabled=motorState;report.pvsRestored=additional.renderPostProcessing==pp&&camera.useOcclusionCulling==occ&&features.Select(f=>f.isActive).SequenceEqual(featureStates)&&lights.Select(l=>l.enabled).SequenceEqual(lightStates)&&renderers.Select(r=>r.enabled).SequenceEqual(rendererStates)&&presentation.enabled==presentationState;}
  }
